        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: JJ Project, Got7, Verse 2\n- People: JB, Jinyoung, Mark, Jackson, Youngjae, BamBam, Yugyeom\n- Companies: JYP Entertainment\n\nFacts:\n- JJ Project is a South Korean pop duo consisting of JB and Jinyoung.\n- JYP Entertainment formed JJ Project, and JJ Project released its first single, \"Bounce,\" in May 2012.\n- Got7 is a South Korean boy group formed by JYP Entertainment.\n- Got7 is composed of seven members: JB, Mark, Jackson, Jinyoung, Youngjae, BamBam, and Yugyeom.\n- Got7 debuted in January 2014 with its first EP, \"Got It?,\" which peaked at number two on the Gaon Album Chart and number one on Billboard's World Albums Chart.\n- Verse 2 is the first extended play by the South Korean male duo JJ Project.",
